How do you predict the intelligence of an output with less intelligence than it costs to produce it? Model routing is an extremely hard problem.

@MatthewBerman made an angel investment in @tomas_hk two years ago, believing that model routing would become a massive business. Now companies are spending $500 million per month on tokens. Increased quality and decreased cost are not mutually exclusive.

Tomas' essay explains how model routing will control the future of economic value, as AI spending surges and intelligent model routing optimizes cost and quality, turning computation into measurable economic value.

You won’t need to be a power user to spend a lot on AI. Instead, your AI agent will need to be a power user to spend a lot on AI.

